edgehog Names: Spiky and Sweet\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[3,\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#sugar-glider-names-tiny-aerial-acrobats\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Sugar Glider Names: Tiny Aerial Acrobats\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[4,\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#ferret-names-mischievous-and-playful\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Ferret Names: Mischievous and Playful\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[5,\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#chinchilla-names-soft-and-sophisticated\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Chinchilla Names: Soft and Sophisticated\\\"}]]}],\\\"$L23\\\"]}]]}],\\\"$L24\\\",\\\"$L25\\\",\\\"$L26\\\",\\\"$L27\\\",\\\"$L28\\\",\\\"$L29\\\",\\\"$L2a\\\",\\\"$L2b\\\",\\\"$L2c\\\",\\\"$L2d\\\",\\\"$L2e\\\",\\\"$L2f\\\",\\\"$L30\\\",\\\"$L31\\\",\\\"$L32\\\",\\\"$L33\\\",\\\"$L34\\\",\\\"$L35\\\",\\\"$L36\\\",\\\"$L37\\\",\\\"$L38\\\",\\\"$L39\\\"]}],\\\"$L3a\\\",\\\"$L3b\\\",\\\"$L3c\\\",\\\"$L3d\\\",\\\"$L3e\\\",\\\"$L3f\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"23:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"li\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-bold mt-0.5 min-w-[1.5em]\\\",\\\"children\\\":[6,\\\".\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"#names-for-other-exotic-small-pets\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 hover:text-primary hover:underline transition-colors text-sm leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Names for Other Exotic Small Pets\\\"}]]}]\\n24:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"The Unique Appeal of Exotic Pet Names\\\"]}]\\n25:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Exotic pets occupy a special place in the hearts of animal lovers who seek companions beyond traditional cats and dogs. Hedgehogs, sugar gliders, ferrets, chinchillas, degus, and other unusual animals bring distinct personalities, fascinating behaviors, and unique care requirements that set them apart from conventional pets. Naming these extraordinary creatures deserves equally extraordinary consideration. A hedgehog named Sonic may be cute, but a hedgehog named Quilliam Shakespeare tells a richer, more memorable story about both the pet and the owner who chose such a delightfully specific name. The American Pet Products Association estimates that approximately 12 million US households keep small animals and exotic pets, a category that continues to grow as more people discover the joys of these unique companions.\\\"]}]\\n26:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Unlike dogs and cats whose naming conventions are well-established after centuries of domestication, exotic pet naming remains a creative frontier. This is an opportunity to break conventions, celebrate uniqueness, and choose names that genuinely reflect the extraordinary nature of these animals. Exotic pets deserve names that honor their specific species traits, their individual personalities, and the special bond they form with owners who have chosen a path less traveled in pet companionship. This guide explores 130+ names across the most popular exotic pet species, with options ranging from pun-filled humor to sophisticated elegance that matches the refined nature of these remarkable creatures.\\\"]}]\\n27:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"5\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Hedgehog Names: Spiky and Sweet\\\"]}]\\n28:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Hedgehogs present one of the most delightful naming paradoxes in the pet world. They are small, spiky creatures who are also undeniably cute, curious, and surprisingly affectionate with proper handling. Their dual nature of defensive prickles and soft underbellies invites names that reflect both their protective exterior and their gentle interior. Quilliam Shakespeare remains the gold standard of hedgehog pun names, offering sophistication, literary reference, and genuine hilarity in equal measure. Quill Smith offers Hollywood flair with the same spike-inspired wordplay. Pokey captures the obvious but endearing physical characteristic that defines hedgehog identity.\\\"]}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"More creative hedgehog names continue to delight: Truffle suits the round, earth-toned, foraging nature of hedgehogs who spend their nights searching for treats. Bramble captures their preference for hedgerows and undergrowth, connecting them to their wild European origins. Chestnut describes the warm brown coloring common to African pygmy hedgehogs. Sonic, while obvious, remains popular for good reason. The connection to the world's most famous fictional hedgehog is instant and joyful. For literary hedgehogs, Mrs. Tiggy-Winkle from Beatrix Potter carries vintage British charm. Pincushion offers charmingly literal description. Each name celebrates the unique contradiction at the heart of hedgehog appeal.\\\"]}]\\n2a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Sugar Glider Names: Tiny Aerial Acrobats\\\"]}]\\n2b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"child\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"ren\\\":[\\\"Sugar gliders are among the most acrobatic and social exotic pets available, capable of gliding remarkable distances and forming intensely strong bonds with their human caretakers. Their name itself references their love of sweet foods and their gliding membrane, inspiring names that celebrate flight, sweetness, and their Australian origins. Sugar, the obvious choice, remains charming for its simplicity and sweetness. Glider works as a direct reference to their defining ability. Pouch, referencing their marsupial nature, adds biological accuracy with genuine cuteness that only sugar glider owners fully appreciate.\\\"]}]\\n2c:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Australian-inspired sugar glider names honor their native habitat beautifully: Sydney, Adelaide, Brisbane, and Darwin provide geographic connections to the continent they call home. Bondi connects to the famous beach and carries bright, sunny energy perfect for these energetic marsupials. Didgeridoo, possibly shortened to Didge, offers uniquely Australian musical reference for pet owners who appreciate cultural depth. For flight-inspired names: Zephyr suggests gentle winds carrying your glider through the air. Nimbus captures the cloud-like floating quality of a sugar glider in full flight. These names celebrate the magical, gravity-defying quality that makes sugar gliders extraordinary companions.\\\"]}]\\n2d:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Ferret Names: Mischievous and Playful\\\"]}]\\n2e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Ferrets are the comedians of the exotic pet world. They are endlessly curious, perpetually playful, and possessed of a unique dooking vocalization that sounds like joyful chuckling. Their long, sinuous bodies, masked faces, and endless energy demand names that match their irrepressible personalities. Bandit, referencing their masked faces and thieving tendencies, remains one of the most perfect ferret names ever conceived. Ferrets are notorious for hiding small objects, earning their reputation as the burglars of the pet world. Slinky describes their distinctive movement, that flowing, impossibly flexible way ferrets navigate spaces.\\\"]}]\\n2f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"More ferret names continue the playful tradition: Noodle captures their long, flexible bodies. Rascal embraces their mischievous nature with honest affection. Wiggles describes their constant motion. Zoom applies to the sudden explosive energy bursts called the ferret war dance. Dook, named for their signature vocalization, offers insider knowledge for experienced ferret owners. For pop culture enthusiasts: Draco Malfoy for white ferrets connects to the Harry Potter universe. Ferret Bueller appeals to the pun-loving owner seeking maximum wordplay. Each name celebrates the chaos, comedy, and genuine affection that ferrets bring to every household lucky enough to include them.\\\"]}]\\n30:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"14\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Chinchilla Names: Soft and Sophisticated\\\"]}]\\n31:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Chinchillas possess the softest fur in the animal kingdom. With up to 60 hairs growing from each follicle, their coat density creates an almost impossibly plush texture that must be experienced to be believed. Their large ears, expressive eyes, and dust-bathing rituals inspire names that celebrate elegance, softness, and their high-altitude Andean origins. Chinchy, a classic nickname, carries genuine affection. Velvet describes their incomparable coat with perfect accuracy. Dusty references their unique dust-bathing behavior, recognizing that chinchillas cannot bathe in water and instead roll in volcanic ash to maintain their extraordinary fur.\\\"]}]\\n32:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Andean and luxury-inspired names elevate chinchilla naming further: Andes directly references\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\" their mountain homeland. Pisco, the Peruvian brandy, offers regional cultural connection. Cashmere suggests luxury befitting the world's softest animal. Silk, Satin, and Plush all describe their extraordinary coat quality. For sophisticated options: Giselle carries ballet elegance appropriate for animals of such physical grace. Percival suggests old-world refinement. These names honor chinchillas as the aristocrats of the small pet world, creatures whose physical perfection has made them prized for centuries and whose personalities reward patient, dedicated owners with years of gentle companionship.\\\"]}]\\n33:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Names for Other Exotic Small Pets\\\"]}]\\n34:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Beyond the most popular exotic pets, a world of unusual animals awaits creative naming. Degus, the social Chilean rodents known for their complex vocal communication, inspire names referencing their communal nature: Comrade, Amigo, or Buddy. Their distinctive orange teeth suggest citrus names like Mango or Tangerine. Gerbils, with their constant digging and tunneling, inspire names like Digger, Tunnel, or Miner. Their desert origins suggest names like Sahara, Dune, or Gobi. Fancy rats, whose intelligence rivals dogs and whose loyalty surprises every first-time rat owner, deserve dignified names that challenge stereotypes.\\\"]}]\\n35:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"19\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"For truly unique exotic pets: Axolotls with their external gills and perpetual smiles inspire names like Gilly, Smiley, or Mudkip. Tarantulas, whose gentle nature surprises arachnophobes, suit names that counter fear with affection: Charlotte, Fluffy, or Aragog. Hermit crabs with their shell-swapping lifestyle inspire names like Shell-don, Mobile Home, or Hermes. The unifying principle across all exotic pet naming: choose names that celebrate the specific, wonderful qualities that make your unusual companion worth the specialized care they require. For thousands more exotic pet name ideas, visit bestanimalnames.com where every animal deserves a great name.\\\"]}]\\n36:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",\\\"20\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10 mb-4 text-gray-900\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Caring for Your Named Exotic Pet\\\"]}]\\n37:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"21\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Once you have chosen the perfect name for your exotic pet, the real work of specialized care begins. Each exotic species has unique requirements that must be researched thoroughly before bringing your companion home. Hedgehogs require specific temperature ranges between 72 and 80 degrees Fahrenheit to prevent hibernation attempts that can be fatal in captivity. Sugar gliders are colony animals who should never be kept alone. They need companionship from other sugar gliders and at least two hours of daily interaction with their human family. Ferrets require ferret-proofed living spaces because their flexible bodies can squeeze through impossibly small openings.\\\"]}]\\n38:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"22\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Explore our name generators for \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"32\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/african-grey-parrot/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"African Grey Parrot\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"55\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/anatolian-leopard/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Anatolian Leopard\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"76\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/airedale-terrier/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Airedale Terrier\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"96\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/african-wild-dog/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"African Wild Dog\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\", and \\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"120\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/amazon-parrot/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Amazon Parrot\\\",\\\" Name Generator\\\"]}],\\\" to find the perfect name for your companion.\\\"]}]\\n39:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"23\\\"\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"Chinchillas need dust baths several times weekly and chew toys to wear down their continuously growing teeth. Degus have similar dental requirements and are prone to diabetes, requiring carefully controlled diets without sugar. The name you choose becomes part of your daily care routine. You will say it during feeding time, cage cleaning, health checks, and bonding sessions. A well-chosen exotic pet name paired with excellent husbandry creates a relationship that rewards both human and animal for many years. For more exotic pet care guides and thousands of name ideas, visit bestanimalnames.com.\\\"]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3a:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12 bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"❓ Frequently Asked Questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What are good names for a pet hedgehog?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Good hedgehog names include punny options like Quilliam, Quill Smith, and Pincushion; cute names like Truffle, Bramble, and Chestnut; and pop culture references like Sonic. The best hedgehog names balance their spiky exterior with their sweet, curious personality.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Do sugar gliders bond with their names?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Sugar gliders are highly social, intelligent marsupials that absolutely learn to recognize their names and the voices of their bonded humans. Using their name consistently during feeding, playtime, and bonding pouch sessions strengthens recognition. Their strong social bonds make name recognition a natural part of their relationship with caretakers.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Can ferrets learn their names?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Yes, ferrets are highly intelligent and can learn their names with consistent training. Use their name paired with positive reinforcement like treats or play. Ferrets respond best to short, distinct names with clear consonant sounds. Their curious, trainable nature makes name recognition one of the easiest commands to teach.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Why can't chinchillas get wet and what names relate to this?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Chinchillas cannot get wet because their extremely dense fur does not dry properly, leading to fungal infections and skin problems. Instead, they take dust baths in volcanic ash. Names like Dusty, Powder, Puff, and Ash reference this unique grooming behavior while celebrating one of the most distinctive aspects of chinchilla care and biology.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-xl p-5 group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-semibold cursor-pointer group-open:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What are the best names for unusual exotic pets?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-3 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The best exotic pet names celebrate each species' most distinctive traits. Use a hedgehog's spines with names like Quilliam, a sugar glider's flight with names like Zephyr, a ferret's mischief with names like Bandit, or a chinchilla's softness with names like Velvet. Species-specific names that acknowledge unique biology create the most meaningful naming choices.\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"3b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-12\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐾 Related Animal Name Generators\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"hedgehog\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/hedgehog/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🦔\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Hedgehog\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",\\\"sugar-glider\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"/animal/sugar-glider/\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 text-center border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"🐿️\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 gr